        "# Extension module\n",
        "\n",
        "An extension module is a Python module implemented in native code, typically C or C++, and loaded into the interpreter as a shared library.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-extension-module)"
